Pastera
=======

Pastera began as a fork of Clipy and retains portions of Clipy's MIT-licensed
source code and Git history. Copyright notices in source files and the root
LICENSE remain in effect for that work.

Subsequent Pastera-specific design, features, documentation, and platform work
are maintained by the Pastera contributors under the same MIT license unless a
file states otherwise.

The macOS app currently uses Pastera-maintained forks of Magnet, KeyHolder, and
Sauce. Those repositories preserve their original licenses and attribution:

- https://github.com/pastera-app/Magnet
- https://github.com/pastera-app/KeyHolder
- https://github.com/pastera-app/Sauce

Third-party dependency licenses remain the property of their respective
authors. Shipping builds must retain the notices required by those licenses.
